==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* [[hvað segirðu]]

===Etymology===
From {{term|hvað||what|lang=is}} + {{term|segir||you say|lang=is}} the second person form of the verb {{term|segja||to say|lang=is}} + {{term|þú||you|lang=is}}. Literally meaning "what say you?".

===Phrase===
'''[[hvað]] [[segja#Icelandic|segir]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]]?'''

# [[how are you]]?
#: '''''Hvað segir þú'''? - [[Allt gott]], [[takk fyrir]].''
#:: '''How are you?''' - I'm fine, thanks.
#: '''''Hvað segir þú''' gott?''
#:: '''How are you'''?

